me{cos}⁡(3t)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t)+40\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t) \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is $\\text{zero for all }t\\in R.$\n\nTherefore, the set ${{x}_{1}(t),{x}_{2}(t)}$ is linearly $\\text{dependent}$ on $R.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186352416 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ee461d3e-3afa-51c6-bddd-355668cac3ec" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Linearly Independent Vector-Valued Functions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed55b08a-1272-5331-be00-79bf8e3f5d3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352418} {:answer/id #uuid "cc4a1672-4daf-56d2-ac73-9fe227ee3adb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352419} {:answer/id #uuid "f7375b9a-9a2e-56bd-880a-7b3be141fa56" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cos}^{2}⁡(2t)+9{sin}^{2}⁡(2t)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352420} {:answer/id #uuid "fac60da7-f076-59d7-879b-72395900977a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352421}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fac60da7-f076-59d7-879b-72395900977a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352421} :answer-field/id #uuid "0db9a392-2f94-51f9-b934-4a0699eb90c0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352417} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a0e9f589-0178-5188-b9e9-48bd9e463cc6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "nonzero for at least one $t\\in R$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352423} {:answer/id #uuid "120ef7d2-e437-50e1-9c2e-f8d3ac197e73" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "zero for all $t\\in R$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352424}] :answer-field/correct {:answ